# doged — Tobias Ruck's Dogecoin ABC implementation (direct clone, no patches)
#
# workspace-doged is a direct clone of git@github.com:doged-io/doged.git
# pinned at the version in daemon/doged-version.
#
# There is no patch series here — doged is its own project and is not derived
# from bitcoin-abc 252182e9 by applying a diff.  The fork point between
# doged and bitcoin-abc is 5c6880edbc (June 2024), and 1723 doged-specific
# commits have accumulated since then.
#
# To set up the workspace:   make setup SERIES=doged
# To advance to newer doged: SERIES=doged make refresh COMMIT=v0.5.0
# To build:                  make build SERIES=doged
#
# Why we track doged:
#   - Tobias designed the Mitra transaction format (target for V2)
#   - Reference for Chronik indexer improvements
#   - Avalanche consensus reference for V2 consensus layer
#   - Studying it alongside V1/V2 informs the logond framework design
